  "description": "After watching his first love marry his best friend, Eins Lainswaine resigns himself to life with another violet-eyed woman. Ye-Hi Lee never expected to be part of his story, until she is reincarnated as Eins’ reluctant wife, Märchen Lainswaine. On the bright side, twins Lieph and Joseph remind Ye-Hi Lee of her deceased siblings at every turn. Could the Lainswaines overcome a lifetime of tragic accidents (and mysterious circumstances) to become adoptive parents…and maybe even something more? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
